WEBVTT

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:02.210
that is truly addressing 
the future challenges

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:04.814
of the universe, of the globe,

00:20:04.814 --> 00:20:08.412
using a different framework 
and a different set of values.

00:20:08.609 --> 00:20:13.237
And this is where, I think,
the language importance comes.

00:20:13.237 --> 00:20:18.492
And I think this is one dimension of it
when you speak about it globally.

00:20:18.492 --> 00:20:20.995
When you speak about it 
from a regional perspective,

00:20:20.995 --> 00:20:24.995
I think it is very important 
for the population of the region

00:20:24.995 --> 00:20:28.075
to be connected to their history, 
connected to their culture,

00:20:28.573 --> 00:20:33.727
feel that they can really have 
their own mother tongue use